<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Generador Creativo</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    /* Paleta ink wash */
    --paper: #f2efe9;          /* papel washi */
    --paper-2: #e7e2d8;        /* papel sombreado */
    --ink: #1c1a17;            /* tinta negra */
    --ink-soft: #3a3630;       /* tinta aguada */
    --ink-mist: #6f6a61;       /* tinta diluida */
    --ink-faint: #a8a29a;      /* tinta muy diluida */
    --seal: #a23b2a;           /* sello rojo */
    --seal-soft: #c4654f;
    --jade: #4f6b5e;           /* verde tinta */
    --card: rgba(255, 253, 248, 0.62);
    --border: rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.14);
    --shadow: rgba(28, 26, 23, 0.10);
    --font-serif: 'Fraunces', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    --font-sans: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html, body { min-height: 100%; }
  body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 10%, rgba(28,26,23,0.07), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 90%, rgba(79,107,94,0.08), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(160deg, var(--paper), var(--paper-2));
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    color: var(--ink);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4.2vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  h1 span { color: var(--seal); }

  /* NAV */
  nav {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.35rem; justify-content: center;
    background: var(--card); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    padding: 0.4rem; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px var(--shadow);
  }
  nav button {
    font-family: var(--font-sans); border: none; background: transparent;
    color: var(--ink-mist); font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  nav button:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  nav button.activo {
    background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(28,26,23,0.25);
  }

  #subnav { display: none; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.35rem; justify-content: center; }
  #subnav.visible { display: flex; }
  #subnav button {
    font-family: var(--font-sans); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: rgba(255,253,248,0.5); color: var(--ink-mist);
    font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 500; padding: 0.38rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  #subnav button:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  #subnav button.activo {
    border-color: var(--seal); color: var(--seal);
    background: rgba(255,253,248,0.9);
  }

  .panel { max-width: 720px; width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.2rem; }
  .panel[hidden] { display: none; }

  .card {
    background: var(--card); backdrop-filter: blur(18px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 2.2rem 1.9rem;
    text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 18px 50px var(--shadow);
    min-height: 150px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 0.8rem;
    position: relative;
  }
  .card::before {
    content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(28,26,23,0.08); border-radius: 2px; pointer-events: none;
  }
  .chip {
    font-size: 0.68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  #resultado {
    font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.6vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink);
  }
  #resultado .hl  { color: var(--seal);  font-weight: 700; font-style: italic; cursor: pointer; }
  #resultado .hl2 { color: var(--jade); font-weight: 700; font-style: italic; cursor: pointer; }
  #resultado .hl.fijado, #resultado .hl2.fijado {
    outline: 1.5px dashed var(--ink-soft); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .animate { animation: pop 0.5s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.3,1); }
  @keyframes pop {
    0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
    100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .meta {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-mist);
  }
  .meta span {
    background: rgba(28,26,23,0.05); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem; border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .acciones { display: flex; gap: 0.55rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
  .acciones button {
    font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.72rem 1.4rem; border: none; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--paper); background: var(--ink);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, background 0.2s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(28,26,23,0.22);
  }
  .acciones button:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); background: var(--ink-soft); }
  .acciones button:active { transform: scale(0.97); }
  .acciones button.sec {
    background: rgba(255,253,248,0.7); color: var(--ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--border); box-shadow: 0 4px 14px var(--shadow);
  }
  .acciones button.sec:hover { background: #fffdf8; }
  .acciones button.seal {
    background: var(--seal); color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(162,59,42,0.28);
  }
  .acciones button.seal:hover { background: #8c3022; }

  .historial { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--ink-mist); }
  .historial h2 {
    font-size: 0.68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem; color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .historial ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .historial li {
    padding: 0.55rem 0.85rem; background: rgba(255,253,248,0.5);
    border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--ink);
  }

  /* BANCO */
  .banco-item {
    background: rgba(255,253,248,0.6); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }
  .banco-item .texto { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .banco-item .tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.68rem; }
  .banco-item .tags span {
    background: rgba(162,59,42,0.08); color: var(--seal);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .banco-item .acciones-mini { display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .banco-item .acciones-mini button {
    font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border); background: rgba(255,253,248,0.85);
    color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }
  .banco-item .acciones-mini button:hover { background: #fffdf8; }
  .banco-item .acciones-mini button.eliminar { color: var(--seal); }
  .banco-vacio { text-align: center; color: var(--ink-mist); font-size: 0.88rem; padding: 2rem 0; }

  .barra-banco {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--ink-mist);
  }
  .barra-banco .botones { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .barra-banco button {
    font-size: 0.76rem; padding: 0.42rem 0.85rem; border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border); background: rgba(255,253,248,0.85);
    color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }
  .barra-banco button:hover { background: #fffdf8; }
  .barra-banco button.peligro { color: var(--seal); }

  select.filtro {
    font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.76rem; padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: rgba(255,253,248,0.85); color: var(--ink); cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* CATÁLOGO DE COMPOSICIONES */
  .paneles-wood { margin: 1.2rem 0 1.5rem; }
  .paneles-cabecera { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:.7rem; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:.7rem; }
  .paneles-cabecera h2 { margin:0; font-size:.72rem; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink-mist); }
  .paneles-cabecera button { border:1px solid var(--border); background:rgba(255,253,248,.8); color:var(--ink); border-radius:999px; padding:.4rem .8rem; cursor:pointer; font:600 .72rem var(--font-sans); }
  .paneles-ayuda { margin:.25rem 0 .8rem; color:var(--ink-mist); font-size:.75rem; line-height:1.5; }
  .paneles-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:.65rem; }
  .panel-wood { border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px; padding:.5rem; background:rgba(255,253,248,.58); cursor:pointer; text-align:left; color:var(--ink); transition:border-color .15s,transform .15s,background .15s; min-width:0; }
  .panel-wood:hover { transform:translateY(-2px); border-color:var(--ink-mist); }
  .panel-wood.seleccionado { border:2px solid var(--seal); padding:calc(.5rem - 1px); background:rgba(162,59,42,.07); }
  .panel-wood img { display:block; width:100%; height:112px; object-fit:contain; background:#eee9df; border-radius:3px; }
  .panel-wood .fallback { display:none; height:112px; padding:.6rem; box-sizing:border-box; align-items:center; justify-content:center; text-align:center; background:#e7e2d8; border-radius:3px; font:italic .82rem var(--font-serif); color:var(--ink-soft); }
  .panel-wood .panel-num { display:block; margin:.45rem 0 .15rem; font:700 .62rem var(--font-sans); letter-spacing:1px; color:var(--seal); text-transform:uppercase; }
  .panel-wood strong { display:block; font:600 .78rem var(--font-sans); line-height:1.3; }
  .panel-wood small { display:block; margin-top:.3rem; font:400 .68rem/1.4 var(--font-sans); color:var(--ink-mist); }
  @media (max-width:650px) { .paneles-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); } }
  @media (max-width:390px) { .paneles-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .panel-wood img,.panel-wood .fallback { height:145px; } }

</style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>Generador <span>Creativo</span></h1>

  <nav id="nav"></nav>
  <div id="subnav"></div>

  <!-- ================= PANEL GENERAR ================= -->
  <section class="panel" id="panel-generar">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="chip" id="chip">Combinación</span>
      <p id="resultado">Elige un apartado y pulsa generar…</p>
      <div class="meta" id="meta"></div>

    <div class="paneles-wood" id="paneles-wood" hidden>
      <div class="paneles-cabecera">
        <h2>Composición de la viñeta · Wally Wood</h2>
        <button type="button" id="btn-otras-composiciones">Otras propuestas ↻</button>
      </div>
      <p class="paneles-ayuda">Selecciona una composición para orientar el encuadre. Se muestran 3 propuestas aleatorias de las 22. Si una referencia visual no carga, se conserva su descripción.</p>
      <div class="paneles-grid" id="paneles-grid"></div>
    </div>
    </div>

    <div class="acciones">
      <button id="btn-generar">Generar</button>
      <button id="btn-otra-version" class="sec">Otra versión</button>
      <button id="btn-guardar" class="sec">Guardar en banco</button>
      <button id="btn-prompt" class="seal">Copiar como prompt</button>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size:0.74rem;color:var(--ink-mist);text-align:center;">
      Haz clic en una palabra resaltada para fijarla y que no cambie al regenerar. Vuelve a hacer clic para soltarla.
    </p>

    <div class="historial">
      <h2>Últimas ideas</h2>
      <ul id="historial"></ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================= PANEL BANCO ================= -->
  <section class="panel" id="panel-banco" hidden>
    <div class="barra-banco">
      <span id="contador-banco">0 ideas guardadas</span>
      <div class="botones">
        <select class="filtro" id="filtro-plataforma">
          <option value="">Todas las plataformas</option>
        </select>
        <button id="btn-exportar-txt">Exportar .txt</button>
        <button id="btn-exportar-json">Exportar .json</button>
        <button id="btn-vaciar" class="peligro">Vaciar</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="lista-banco" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.6rem;"></div>
  </section>

<script>
/* =========================================================
   EJES TRANSVERSALES
